      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, me da en la nariz que este Fennekin salvaje\nno se encuentra bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fen...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460065006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No quiere la comida, y en el Centro Pokémon\nno saben decirme qué le pasa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se me ocurre que el dueño de la antigua\nHerboristería que había en la ciudad tal vez<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npueda ayudarnos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te importaría ir a hablar con él mientras yo\nme quedo cuidando de Fennekin?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Suele ir a la Cafetería Prêt-à-Sorber, puede que\nlo encuentres allí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750065006C0065002000690072002000610020006C00610020004300610066006500740065007200ED006100200050007200EA0074002D00E0002D0053006F0072006200650072002C0020007000750065006400650020007100750065000A006C006F00200065006E006300750065006E007400720065007300200061006C006C00ED002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El dueño de la antigua Herboristería suele ir\na la Cafetería Prêt-à-Sorber.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dime, maj<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, ¿qué quieres?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006D0065002C0020006D0061006A00100003110000FF0101006F0061002C002000BF0071007500E900200071007500690065007200650073003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Regentaba usted una Herboristería?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0052006500670065006E007400610062006100200075007300740065006400200075006E006100200048006500720062006F00720069007300740065007200ED0061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hay un Pokémon que no se encuentra bien",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007900200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200071007500650020006E006F00200073006500200065006E006300750065006E0074007200610020006200690065006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que hay un Fennekin enfermo... Entiendo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED0020007100750065002000680061007900200075006E002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00200065006E006600650072006D006F002E002E002E00200045006E007400690065006E0064006F002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Fennekin comen ramitas para armarse\nde valor, o simplemente para calmarse.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si le das una Ramita Revitalizante, seguro que\nse recupera.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006C0065002000640061007300200075006E0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E00740065002C002000730065006700750072006F0020007100750065000A00730065002000720065006300750070006500720061002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cosa es que las Ramitas Revitalizantes crecen\nen lo que ahora es la zona salvaje 5...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que es bastante peligroso ir a buscarlas,\npues podrían atacarte los Pokémon salvajes.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi aun así quieres intentarlo, guíate por el olor\ndulzón que desprenden para encontrarlas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es posible encontrar Ramitas Revitalizantes\nen la zona salvaje 5, en el Distrito Azul.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPodrás distinguirlas por su olor dulzón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está algo marchita... No parece que tenga\npropiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E100200061006C0067006F0020006D0061007200630068006900740061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061000A00700072006F007000690065006400610064006500730020007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La han mordisqueado... No parece que tenga\npropiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000680061006E0020006D006F007200640069007300710075006500610064006F002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061000A00700072006F007000690065006400610064006500730020007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está rota... No parece que tenga propiedades\nrevitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E100200072006F00740061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061002000700072006F00700069006500640061006400650073000A007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está seca y pocha... No parece que tenga\npropiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1002000730065006300610020007900200070006F006300680061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061000A00700072006F007000690065006400610064006500730020007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Despide un olor dulzón...\n¡Has encontrado una Ramita Revitalizante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650073007000690064006500200075006E0020006F006C006F0072002000640075006C007A00F3006E002E002E002E000A00A100480061007300200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610064006F00200075006E0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay que llevársela a Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007900200071007500650020006C006C0065007600E1007200730065006C006100200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una Ramita Revitalizante...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCaramba, tendré que darle las gracias al señor\nde la Herboristería... ¡y a ti por encontrarla!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dásela a Fennekin, rápido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E100730065006C006100200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002C0020007200E1007000690064006F002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le has dado la Ramita Revitalizante a Fennekin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200068006100730020006400610064006F0020006C0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E0074006500200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Kin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se ha puesto bueno al momento! ¡Qué alegría!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530065002000680061002000700075006500730074006F0020006200750065006E006F00200061006C0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0021002000A10051007500E900200061006C00650067007200ED0061002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues parece que Fennekin se ha encariñado\ncontigo. ¿Y si cuidas de él a partir de ahora?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Kin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Has conseguido un Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007300200063006F006E007300650067007500690064006F00200075006E002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuida bien de él.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750069006400610020006200690065006E002000640065002000E9006C002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que tienes las cajas llenas.\nTendrás que hacer sitio si quieres a Fennekin.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
